<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady/off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady/off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were uneven, steady to $1.00 lower. Top $ per cwt. - USDA US 1-3	230-260 lbs early 60.00, late 59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3	260-280 lbs	 58.00-59.00</p>
<p>Sows Scarce.</p>
</text>
